# shadcn/ui

- Primitives live only in `src/components/ui/`.
- Add new primitives with: `npx shadcn@latest add <component>`.
- **Customize the generated files** (variants, sizes, classNames) — do not fork a parallel Button/Input elsewhere.
- Import with the `@/` alias: `import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"`.
- Shared layouts/composites that use several primitives go in `components/common`, not `ui/`.
- Do not install alternate UI kits (MUI, Chakra, Ant Design) unless the user explicitly asks.
